            "enable_h1_tag": false,
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "description": "<p>While we employ this team of highly skilled welders, there are often times when welders may be forced into uncomfortable positions for hours at a time. In these situations, we turn to our FANUC 120ic Robotic Welding Cell to handle the job.</p><p>The Fanuc 120ic Robotic Welding Cell is the perfect piece of equipment for high-quantity welding tasks. Robotic welders improve the efficiency of repetitive and complex tasks with unmatched precision. As a result, mistakes typically caused by worker fatigue are reduced. These robotic welding machines produce quality work that exceeds industry standards.</p>",
